//          the model can reason fully. Any "<<" emitted in reasoning is left as
//          plain text (we do not enter constrained mode here).
// Phase 2: Force-open a fresh constrained span ("<<") for the final answer.
// Phase 3: CloseSpanWithinBudget drives constrained token generation and closes
//          the span at the longest complete parse (longest valid expression),
//          emitting ">>". This prevents premature closure at partial expressions.
// Task guidance primes the model with the exact output format requirements.
// CSD_RATIONALE_END

// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_BEGIN
