//     tokens. After the call, steps is set to maxSteps. The visible growth is at
//     most rb = maxSteps - steps_before, so |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| +
//     steps_before + rb = |generatedPrefix| + maxSteps = |generatedPrefix| + steps.
// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_END

